<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 28-day discount T-bills Friday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 28-day discount T-bills Friday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer a special issue of 28-day discount T-bills at an auction on Friday, the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue would be offered with no par value or minimum acceptable price set in advance, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number    BG3029697003</p>
<p> Term		28 days</p>
<p> Auction date    April 18</p>
<p> Issue date	April 21</p>
<p> Maturity date   May 19</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
